[{"client_msg_id":"3fecdf9b-7eed-41a2-be77-9eeee55deaa4","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"藤子F不二雄のノスタル爺は一度表現が修正されて、全集では修正前に戻ってたような","ts":"1627902354.034600","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1627902399.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JmS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d90bf2d1-459c-4b69-a59c-56be45b728b0","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"で、技術が新しくなって、ドルビーデジタルリマスター版とか出るんでしょ？w","ts":"1627899906.033900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3mD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6567c000-c857-4e95-85f9-5d821aa7e3ca","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"完全版とオリジナル版とディレクターズカット版を別々に売ろう","ts":"1627899317.033300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u8QF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56ba5eae-d848-4d58-af1b-a31fe60a8478","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"修正すると、将来完全版を売れるのでは？長々と注釈をつけて","ts":"1627899245.032900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7T5l7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d76a00f0-05bb-4f7c-98ee-1d44e8b7ddda","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"特に作家はこの手の争いに参加した瞬間YESかNOかの不毛な水掛け論に巻き込まれて\n作家なのに作品作るヒマもなくなるみたいな本末転倒なオチがつくのがつらい","ts":"1627895056.028600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=dl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91753bd0-f9be-4cab-b10d-1b9ae145fac4","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"出版社も作家も売る側なんでなぁ","ts":"1627894953.027000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ew1A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59f7488a-d055-4e1d-907c-568e2fd94392","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"出版側が弱腰だと批判イコール即圧力みたいに機能しちゃって、これはこれで不健全ですね。\nそれは結局、手ぬるい論評しか許されない社会ということになる。","ts":"1627894109.026300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01PMN2BVJQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0xC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2755f804-5ec3-4d55-b4c5-137a43d1a024","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"まあ、実際に修正までさせることが正しいかは別の話ですけどね。\n個人的には、ここから出版社や作者による反論が交わされてはじめて表現の自由に満ち足りた社会になると思います。","ts":"1627893915.025900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rm7N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"000a1fa7-dc27-47e9-bd64-1a921e217c66","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"舞台装置としての狂人はキャラクター性や過去を深堀りせずに悲劇を演出できるので便利といえば便利なんですが、\nあまりそういう展開がテンプレ化されすぎると「ああいう輩は理解しようとするだけムダなのだ」みたいな偏見が強化される節はあるのかもしれない。","ts":"1627893788.025100","edited":{"user":"U01HFNMNB55","ts":"1627894149.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01PMN2BVJQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BBO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a47628a-00a0-4e25-8f11-5b16977c58f6","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"冗談抜きで現実と創作物の区別つかないんじゃない？","ts":"1627888823.024700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p+M4k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C86A26C6-6940-48FA-95D8-742224D5CF32","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"利益を上げるために会社が判断するなら分かるんですけど、創作物までイチャモンつけないでもと思ってしまいますね。トラウマとかある人のことを考えると、自分の考えはバイアスかかってるのかな・・","ts":"1627888181.022700","edited":{"user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","ts":"1627888217.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DOeAB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69053b9d-3808-408a-bc66-181258d6b2bd","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"社会的圧力によって作品が変更されたところまで一連の芸術だなとか思っちゃった","ts":"1627888167.022300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U01PMN2BVJQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TlYx"}]},{"clien